cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this tutorial repository, please cite it via the Zenodo DOI below. To cite the AguaTrack-ARCO-SA dataset itself, see the dataset card on HuggingFace."
title: "AguaTrack-ARCO-SA Tutorial"
abstract: >-
  Companion notebooks for the AguaTrack-ARCO-SA dataset (WAM2Layers
  backward moisture-tracking output over South America, 0.25° daily,
  1990–2019).
  Six Colab-runnable tutorials reproduce the data-paper figures: a
  flash-flood event analysis (Serra do Mar 2011), a precipitationshed
  climatology (Santa Cruz, Bolivia), ENSO-phase source composites
  (Central Chile), the Central-Chile megadrought decade, and a
  monthly precipitationshed view of one city across a single year.
authors:
